subgraph AT["src/attention/ · ★ AMOGH"]
    direction LR
    A1["<b>extract.py</b><br/>hook the layers"]
    A2["<b>aggregate.py</b> · attention is (N·T) by (N·T)<br/>collapse TIME, then heads, then layers → N x N.<br/>PRIMARY: encoder social attention, mean over time.<br/>decoder and cross are robustness. record the row entropy"]
    A3["<b>rank.py</b><br/>order the edges INTO the ego.<br/>rank_attn and rank_dist"]
    A1 --> A2 --> A3
